      "target": "The dried fish is on its way! Let's keep working together for now!"
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "嘴巴寂寞了……快去完成一轮任务！",
      "target": "I'm craving a snack… Let's hurry up and finish one more task!"
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "陪我多工作一会儿，鱼干自动到账～",
      "target": "Work with me a little longer, and dried-fish treats will arrive automatically~"
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "现在喂我也只会饿着肚子说谢谢哦～",
      "target": "For now, all I can do is say thank you on an empty stomach~"
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "粮仓见底啦，用几轮任务换一条鱼干吧～",
      "target": "The pantry's nearly empty! Let's finish a few more tasks to earn a dried-fish treat~"
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "饿着肚子等你完成下一轮任务～",
      "target": "I'll wait for you to finish the next task, even on an empty stomach~"
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "小鱼干藏在你的工作里，去找找看！",
      "target": "Dried-fish treats are hiding in your work—go find them!"
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "先工作后干饭，我们的约定哦～",
      "target": "Work first, snacks later. That's our deal~"
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "粮仓见底，全靠感情撑着了",
      "target": "The pantry's nearly empty, but we have each other."
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "饿是真饿，活也是真得干",
      "target": "I'm really hungry, but the work still needs doing."
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "画饼充饥……不对，画鱼干充饥",
      "target": "Drawing a pie to stave off hunger… no, a dried-fish treat instead!"
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "没鱼干的日子，靠意志力过",
      "target": "On days without dried fish, I have to rely on willpower."
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "下一轮任务，我闻到了鱼干味",
      "target": "I can smell dried fish in the next task!"
    },
    {
      "selector": "[data-dsh-pet-root]",
      "source": "先记账上，欠我两条，记住啦",
      "target": "Put two dried-fish treats on my tab. I'll remember!"
    }
  ],
